@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+-- SoFIFA already tags symmetric positions with a side (LCB/RCB, LDM/RDM,
+-- LCM/RCM, LAM/RAM, LS/RS) before the sync route collapses them down to our
+-- coarse GranularPosition taxonomy (CB/DM/CM/AM/ST). That side is thrown away
+-- today. Capturing it lets the pitch views place e.g. two center-backs
+-- left-to-right the way they actually line up (a left-footed LCB left of a
+-- right-footed RCB) without inventing a 13th position or scraping anything
+-- new -- the raw tag is already in every payload playwright-sofifa.js sends.
+alter table players
+  add column if not exists side_hint text check (side_hint in ('L', 'R'));
+
+comment on column players.side_hint is
+  'Soft left/right bias derived from SoFIFA''s raw primary position tag (LCB/RCB, LDM/RDM, LCM/RCM, LAM/RAM, LS/RS). Null for centrally-symmetric or unknown players. Used only to order same-position pairs on a pitch view, never for eligibility or scoring.';
